{"seq":2,"slug":"serving-metrics","title":"服务化指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/serving-metrics","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务化指标\">服务化指标</h1><p>「这个模型快不快」是个会误导人的问题。同一个部署，对盯着光标等回答的聊天用户、对批量跑离线总结的数据管道、对每月付 GPU 账单的运维，「快」的含义完全不同。要把推理服务做好，第一步是把模糊的「快」拆成几个互相拉扯、可量化的指标，并理解它们之间的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-延迟-吞吐与-goodput\">核心概念：延迟、吞吐与 goodput</h2><p>把指标摊开看，它们分属两个视角：单请求的延迟（用户体感）与系统整体的吞吐（资源效率），而 goodput 是把二者绑在一起的桥梁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一个推理请求] --&gt; B[排队等待]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Prefill 完成&lt;br/&gt;吐出第 1 个 token]&#10;    C --&gt; D[逐 token decode]&#10;    D --&gt; E[最后 1 个 token]&#10;    C -. 测量 .-&gt; F[TTFT&lt;br/&gt;首 token 时间]&#10;    D -. 测量 .-&gt; G[TPOT / ITL&lt;br/&gt;每 token 时间]&#10;    E -. 测量 .-&gt; H[E2E 端到端时延]&#10;    I[系统全部请求] --&gt; J[吞吐&lt;br/&gt;tokens/s 或 req/s]&#10;    J --&gt; K{满足 SLA?}&#10;    K --&gt;|是| L[Goodput&lt;br/&gt;有效吞吐]&#10;    K --&gt;|否| M[超时/违约请求&lt;br/&gt;不计入 goodput]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一个推理请求] --&gt; B[排队等待]\n    B --&gt; C[Prefill 完成&lt;br/&gt;吐出第 1 个 token]\n    C --&gt; D[逐 token decode]\n    D --&gt; E[最后 1 个 token]\n    C -. 测量 .-&gt; F[TTFT&lt;br/&gt;首 token 时间]\n    D -. 测量 .-&gt; G[TPOT / ITL&lt;br/&gt;每 token 时间]\n    E -. 测量 .-&gt; H[E2E 端到端时延]\n    I[系统全部请求] --&gt; J[吞吐&lt;br/&gt;tokens/s 或 req/s]\n    J --&gt; K{满足 SLA?}\n    K --&gt;|是| L[Goodput&lt;br/&gt;有效吞吐]\n    K --&gt;|否| M[超时/违约请求&lt;br/&gt;不计入 goodput]</pre><p>延迟侧的两个核心量直接对应 <a href=\"inference-and-kv-cache\">推理流程</a> 的两阶段。<strong>TTFT（Time To First Token，首 token 时间）</strong> 衡量用户从发出请求到看见第一个字的等待，由排队时间加 prefill 时间决定。<strong>TPOT（Time Per Output Token，每 token 时间）</strong>，也叫 ITL（Inter-Token Latency），衡量后续每个字蹦出的间隔，由 decode 每步耗时决定。端到端时延则近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>TPOT</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{e2e} = T_{queue} + T_{prefill} + (n_{out} - 1) \\times \\text{TPOT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TPOT</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是输出 token 数。这个分解很有用：对话场景输出短，TTFT 占大头；长文生成场景，TPOT 乘以输出长度才是大头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要看-goodput-而不是吞吐\">为什么要看 goodput 而不是吞吐</h2><p>吞吐（throughput）是单位时间处理的 token 数或请求数，是资源效率的直接体现。但单看吞吐会骗人：你可以把批次开到极大，吞吐数字很漂亮，但每个用户的 TTFT 和 TPOT 都被拖垮，体验崩坏。</p>\n<p><strong>Goodput（有效吞吐）</strong> 修正了这个偏差：它只统计「满足 SLA 约束」的那部分吞吐。一个请求若违反了 TTFT 或 TPOT 的承诺，它消耗的算力就是白费，不计入 goodput。这个概念由 DistServe 等工作明确提出，是 2026 年 prefill/decode 分离架构的优化目标——分离的初衷正是为了在不互相干扰的前提下同时拉高两类 SLA 下的 goodput。</p>\n<p>形式上，给定 SLA 阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{TTFT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{TPOT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Goodput</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>满足 </mtext><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> 且 </mtext><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> 的请求数</mtext></mrow><mtext>时间</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Goodput} = \\frac{\\text{满足 } TTFT \\le \\tau_{TTFT} \\text{ 且 } TPOT \\le \\tau_{TPOT} \\text{ 的请求数}}{\\text{时间}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Goodput</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时间</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">满足</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的请求数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>衡量集群时，goodput 比吞吐更诚实——它逼你为「在约束内」的吞吐负责，而 <a href=\"../practice/cost-sla-optimization\">成本与 SLA 优化</a> 正是围绕「每美元 goodput」来算账的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分位数-为什么-p50-会撒谎\">分位数：为什么 p50 会撒谎</h2><p>报告延迟时绝不能只看平均值或中位数。LLM 流量天然长尾：长上下文请求的 prefill 慢、被大批次拖累的请求 TPOT 抖动、冷启动副本拉高个别请求。平均值会被大量短请求拉得很好看，而少数用户体验糟糕的请求被淹没。</p>\n<p>业界标准是看高分位：p95、p99。下表给出 2026 年常见场景的参考 SLA 目标（来自公开的生产实践基准，具体数值随业务而定）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>TTFT p95 目标</th>\n<th>TPOT p95 目标</th>\n<th>优化侧重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交互式聊天</td>\n<td>&lt; 500 ms</td>\n<td>&lt; 50 ms/token</td>\n<td>TTFT 优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG / 长上下文问答</td>\n<td>&lt; 5 s</td>\n<td>&lt; 50 ms/token</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码补全</td>\n<td>&lt; 200 ms</td>\n<td>&lt; 30 ms/token</td>\n<td>极致低 TTFT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线批处理</td>\n<td>无硬约束</td>\n<td>无硬约束</td>\n<td>纯吞吐/成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 TPOT 阈值的隐含意义：50 ms/token 约等于每秒 20 个 token，略快于多数人的阅读速度，超过它再快用户也感知不到——这给了「TPOT 够用就好、把余量换吞吐」的工程空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标之间的根本权衡\">指标之间的根本权衡</h2><p>这些指标不能同时最优，它们在一条权衡曲线上互相拉扯，理解这点比记住任何单个数字都重要。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吞吐 vs 延迟</strong>：增大批次（更多请求挤进一次 GPU 前向）提升吞吐，但每个请求的 TPOT 变长，因为单步要算更多 token。<a href=\"../optimization/continuous-batching\">连续批处理</a> 的全部精巧之处，就是在这条曲线上找更好的工作点。</li>\n<li><strong>TTFT vs TPOT</strong>：prefill 抢占 GPU 会让正在 decode 的请求卡顿（TPOT 升），而把 prefill 拆小（chunked prefill）能缓解，但又略增 TTFT。</li>\n<li><strong>延迟 vs 成本</strong>：要压低 p99，往往得留出算力余量、降低单卡负载，单位成本随之上升。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[增大批次大小] --&gt; B[吞吐上升]&#10;    A --&gt; C[单请求 TPOT 上升]&#10;    B --&gt; D[单位成本下降]&#10;    C --&gt; E[违反 TPOT SLA 风险]&#10;    E --&gt; F[goodput 可能反而下降]&#10;    D --&gt; G[需在 SLA 内取最大批]\">graph TD\n    A[增大批次大小] --&gt; B[吞吐上升]\n    A --&gt; C[单请求 TPOT 上升]\n    B --&gt; D[单位成本下降]\n    C --&gt; E[违反 TPOT SLA 风险]\n    E --&gt; F[goodput 可能反而下降]\n    D --&gt; G[需在 SLA 内取最大批]</pre><p>这条权衡曲线是整个 hub 的暗线：每一项优化本质上都是把这条曲线往右下方推——同样的延迟下拿更高吞吐，或同样的吞吐下拿更低延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么测才靠谱\">怎么测才靠谱</h2><p>测量本身有坑。常见的失真来源包括：用单请求 benchmark 冒充并发性能、忽略排队时间只测计算时间、用固定长度的合成 prompt 掩盖真实流量的长尾、预热不足让冷启动污染数据。</p>\n<p>可靠的做法是用贴近真实分布的负载发生器（如 vLLM 自带的 benchmark 脚本、或开源的 LLMPerf 类工具），按目标 QPS 注入泊松到达的请求，分别报告各分位的 TTFT、TPOT、E2E 和系统 goodput。压测时要扫描并发梯度，画出「延迟-吞吐」曲线找拐点——拐点之后再加负载只会让延迟爆炸而吞吐不再涨，那就是这套配置的容量上限，也是 <a href=\"../practice/deployment-autoscaling\">部署与自动扩缩</a> 设定扩缩阈值的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>延迟分两段：TTFT 由 prefill 决定、用户等首字；TPOT/ITL 由 decode 决定、用户看流畅度；端到端时延是二者按输出长度的加权。</li>\n<li>吞吐衡量效率但会骗人，goodput 只算满足 SLA 的有效吞吐，是更诚实的集群优化目标。</li>\n<li>永远看 p95/p99 而非均值——LLM 流量长尾严重，均值会掩盖糟糕的尾部体验。</li>\n<li>指标互相拉扯：批次越大吞吐越高但延迟越差；这条「延迟-吞吐」权衡曲线是所有优化的共同战场。</li>\n<li>测量要用真实分布、泊松到达、扫并发梯度找容量拐点，否则数字漂亮但不可信。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服务化指标","id":"服务化指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：延迟、吞吐与 goodput","id":"核心概念-延迟-吞吐与-goodput"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要看 goodput 而不是吞吐","id":"为什么要看-goodput-而不是吞吐"},{"level":2,"text":"分位数：为什么 p50 会撒谎","id":"分位数-为什么-p50-会撒谎"},{"level":2,"text":"指标之间的根本权衡","id":"指标之间的根本权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么测才靠谱","id":"怎么测才靠谱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推理流程与 KV 缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/inference-and-kv-cache"},"next":{"title":"自回归解码瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/decoding-bottlenecks"}}